# A5 the sunset globe (look A): once the sunny globe is fixed up and the tiny machine is home, a pet
# brings the broken sunset globe home from the far fields. It slides in beside the sunny one, its
# fixes list takes "next up"'s place, and the bits pills show its bits. Shooing out the nest makes it
# work: your hand pulls it now (its lever sags until the pulley), and your pet and the workers crank
# the sunny one. Corks, pulleys, copper wire and amber glass fix the rest; its hatch gives sunset
# boxes. The upgrades page frames the sunset branch; the sunny sign pans back.
from rich
view full
pets 12
coins 900000000000
fix tape
fix oil
fix flap
fix glass
fix wires
fix chute2
fix chute3
fix chute4
fix shine 10
fix heavy 3
fix double 5
fix triple 2
fix shiny 5
fix fever 3
fix drops
toy snail
find intel_fence
find tiny_machine
wait popup
click "lovely"
wait popup
click "lovely"
wait popup
click "lovely"
tab machine
wait 0.5
expect no-text "sunset fixes"
shot before
find sunset_globe
wait 2
expect text "sunset fixes"
expect text "0 corks"
expect fits
shot arrived
click "upgrades"
wait 0.8
expect fits
shot tree_arrived
page machine 0
wait 0.5
click name:fix_row_cork
wait 0.3
shot row_cork
click name:fix_row_nest
bits cork 5
bits pulley 4
bits wire 5
bits amber 5
wait 0.3
click "fix it"
wait 1.5
expect fits
shot nest_fixed
pull 1 0.6
shot sagging_pull
wait 1.5
teach machine
task machine
auto-tool crank 3
tab automation
wait 1
click "teach the others"
wait 1
click "workers"
wait 1
spots machine 3
wait 1
click "fill up"
wait 1
tab machine
wait 4
expect fits
shot workers
click "fix it"
wait 1.5
shot corked
click "fix it"
wait 1.5
shot pulley
pull 1 0.3
shot two_chutes
wait 1.5
click "fix it"
wait 1.5
shot amber
click "fix it"
wait 1.5
expect no-text "sunset fixes"
expect text "next up"
expect fits
shot hatch
next-prize box
pull 1 1.8
expect pile sunset 1+
expect pile starter 0
shot sunset_box
wait 3
click "upgrades"
wait 0.8
expect fits
shot tree_sunset
click name:sign_sunny
wait 1
expect fits
shot tree_sunny
click name:sign_sunset
wait 1
expect fits
shot tree_back
toy owl normal 1
tab collection
click "toys"
wait 0.5
click name:set_sunset
wait 0.3
expect text "sunset friends"
expect fits
shot sunset_toys
unlock location:orchard
place orchard
wait 1
expect text "brings home corks"
expect fits
shot orchard_card
